            <ArticleTitle>[Postspinal headache as an anesthesiology problem].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>444-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spinal anaesthesia, is nowadays one of the safest anaesthetic techniques with low complication rates. Postspinal headache is a complication of spinal anaesthesia. This paper presents several factors associated with the development of postspinal headache and discusses the reduction, prediction and treatment of postspinal headache.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
